    imageSourceLabel="Anker"
    imageSourceUrl="https://www.anker.com/products/a9196-70w-desk-clamp-usb-power-strip"
    productMeta="Model A9196 · Amazon ASIN B0FFGZH2S2 · Verified August 27, 2026"
    tags={['Clamp-mounted','10 connections','70W USB total']}
    why="It puts 6 AC outlets, 2 USB-C ports, and 2 USB-A ports at the desk edge while the clamp keeps the unit from sliding during normal plug and unplug actions. This is most useful when a floor-mounted strip is hard to reach or leaves cords hanging loosely."
